    <string name="ton_321_mehrkanal">Multichannel</string>
    <string name="ton_321_auto_description">Automatic — German4K Ultra detects what your TV, soundbar or receiver can play and picks the best sound: Dolby/DTS goes straight to a receiver, otherwise clean stereo. Recommended.</string>
    <string name="ton_321_mehrkanal_description">Multichannel — 5.1/7.1 is decoded in the app and sent as multichannel PCM, without Dolby/DTS passthrough. For TVs that go silent with passthrough.</string>
    <string name="ton_321_receiver_description">Receiver — Dolby and DTS sound goes to your AV receiver or soundbar as a bitstream, in the format they accept. If the sound drops out, German4K Ultra switches to stereo and tells you.</string>
